				"For fluids, use Input Hatches and Output Hatches; ordinary input/output hatches can only hold &cone fluid&r; ordinary Output Hatches and the LV Giant Output Hatch can lock their fluid output by marking the second slot from the top down (drag from JEI, mark with a bucket containing the fluid, etc.)"
